        "is_free": false,
        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2364180/extras/ed5b3b5ddd386c80e3a75497fd96ed70.avif?t=1777305966\" width=600 height=102 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to my home, an enchanted cottage named &quot;<i>The Merry Fairy</i>&quot;, because I am, indeed, quite a merry one. I invited you here to rest and relax. But I must warn you...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2364180/extras/16f28d5e5f9b18b9eb173fc40aaa04b8.avif?t=1777305966\" width=600 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >My home is filled with abundance and serenity. There is nothing that will stress you, challenge you or push you towards any goal. All is plentiful and readily available. You need not worry about a thing. Just relax and unwind in this enchanted haven of mine. I've asked the weather to accommodate your wishes, my friends to come by if you need any help or company, and a handful of enchanted candles that will light your space for as long as you wish.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2364180/extras/b270eb7926996eb6ea660b0741db4d74.poster.avif?t=1777305966\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2364180/extras/b270eb7926996eb6ea660b0741db4d74.webm?t=1777305966\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2364180/extras/b270eb7926996eb6ea660b0741db4d74.mp4?t=1777305966\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I also left you a brand new journal that you write your thoughts in and can decorate as you please. I found the art of scrapbook journaling a powerful practice to  master my own magic. Since I sense you might be a magical creature, like me, I think you might find scrapbook journaling as exciting as I did. You may explore my desk as if it were your own, and use any decorations you like! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I wish you a pleasant stay!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2364180/extras/ae7a6d724156e6d4a2991485a1ccb366.avif?t=1777305966\" width=570 height=135 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2364180/extras/ed5b3b5ddd386c80e3a75497fd96ed70.avif?t=1777305966\" width=600 height=102 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to my home, an enchanted cottage named &quot;<i>The Merry Fairy</i>&quot;, because I am, indeed, quite a merry one. I invited you here to rest and relax. But I must warn you...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2364180/extras/16f28d5e5f9b18b9eb173fc40aaa04b8.avif?t=1777305966\" width=600 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >My home is filled with abundance and serenity. There is nothing that will stress you, challenge you or push you towards any goal. All is plentiful and readily available. You need not worry about a thing. Just relax and unwind in this enchanted haven of mine. I've asked the weather to accommodate your wishes, my friends to come by if you need any help or company, and a handful of enchanted candles that will light your space for as long as you wish.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2364180/extras/b270eb7926996eb6ea660b0741db4d74.poster.avif?t=1777305966\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2364180/extras/b270eb7926996eb6ea660b0741db4d74.webm?t=1777305966\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2364180/extras/b270eb7926996eb6ea660b0741db4d74.mp4?t=1777305966\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I also left you a brand new journal that you write your thoughts in and can decorate as you please. I found the art of scrapbook journaling a powerful practice to  master my own magic. Since I sense you might be a magical creature, like me, I think you might find scrapbook journaling as exciting as I did. You may explore my desk as if it were your own, and use any decorations you like! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I wish you a pleasant stay!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2364180/extras/ae7a6d724156e6d4a2991485a1ccb366.avif?t=1777305966\" width=570 height=135 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
        "short_description": "The Merry Fairy is a scrapbook journal simulator set in a fairytale environment. Discover your inner magic by journaling and decorating in Fairy's enchanted cottage, always peaceful, safe and abundant. Choose the weather, light some candles, put on some Fairy music and let your creativity flow.",
        "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support",
        "reviews": "“The Merry Fairy's fairytale inscriptions and charming world design make for an extraordinarily beautiful and well-orchestrated journaling expedition.”<br>8.5 – Gaming dot net<br><br>“The Merry Fairy is an excellent idea for those who already love collecting stickers, fairy tales, scrapbooking, and journaling. It sets out to create a cozy, magical place for you to relax, and it does so beautifully.”<br> I Like it a Lot – Ladies Gamers<br><br>“All too often, we seek to escape our own enchanted self and find comfort outside of ourselves. Yet the truth is, The Merry Fairy is a gentle exercise of imagination that you will be able to use anywhere, anytime. The most powerful magic lies deep inside your very own heart.”<br>Cozy Gaming Panda<br>",
